{"unit_id":"LJY7812__dsh-winui-skin#feature-accent","repo":"LJY7812/dsh-winui-skin","commit":"1a336785265242a9fce7216a4e0920db886a1bb2","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-winui-skin 的功能「系统强调色」：Windows 宿主读取注册表强调色色阶，并通过本地 API 路由提供给客户端。客户端把色阶用于按钮、链接、选区等主题 token，并按亮度选择按钮文字颜色。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:69-89","lib/index.js:96-135","lib/client.js:229-264"]}
