{"unit_id":"LJY7812__dsh-winui-skin#caveat-windows-accent","repo":"LJY7812/dsh-winui-skin","commit":"1a336785265242a9fce7216a4e0920db886a1bb2","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-winui-skin 使用前须知：系统强调色仅在 Windows 上从注册表读取；非 Windows、读取失败或策略限制时客户端回退到默认蓝色（见 lib/index.js:69-89、lib/client.js:253-264）。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:69-89","lib/client.js:253-264"]}
